<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title><%= imovel.corretora.nome %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="<%= imovel.corretora.logoMark %>">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&family=Manrope:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    :root{--bg:#0b0b0c;--bg-2:#121214;--fg:#f3efe8;--fg-2:#a8a39a;--champ:#d6b982;--line:rgba(243,239,232,.12)}
    body{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg-2);color:var(--fg);min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    .card{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;align-items:end;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);max-width:1100px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:48px clamp(24px,6vw,64px) 0}
    .photo{position:relative;max-width:460px;width:100%;margin:0 auto}
    .photo img{width:100%;height:auto;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 86%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 86%,transparent)}
    .text{padding-bottom:64px}
    .logo{height:56px;margin-bottom:40px;opacity:.95}
    .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--champ);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px}
    h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(40px,5.5vw,68px);line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px}
    h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--champ)}
    .tag{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px);color:var(--fg-2);margin-bottom:28px}
    .exp{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:28px}
    .exp b{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:64px;line-height:.9;color:var(--champ)}
    .exp span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.7}
    p.lead{color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:44ch;margin-bottom:32px}
    .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;border:1px solid rgba(243,239,232,.2);transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s}
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn--wa{background:#25d366;border-color:#25d366;color:#fff}
    .btn--line:hover{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
    .btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
    footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;color:#5f636d;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    @media (max-width:760px){.card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;padding-top:32px}.text{order:1;padding-bottom:36px}.photo{order:2;max-width:320px}.logo{height:44px;margin-bottom:28px}.exp b{font-size:52px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="photo"><img src="<%= imovel.corretora.foto %>" alt="<%= imovel.corretora.pessoa %>"></div>
    <div class="text">
      <img class="logo" src="<%= imovel.corretora.logoWhite %>" alt="<%= imovel.corretora.nome %>">
      <p class="eyebrow">Apresentações exclusivas de imóveis</p>
      <h1>Daniela <em>Ribeiro</em></h1>
      <p class="tag"><%= imovel.corretora.tagline %></p>
      <div class="exp"><b><%= imovel.corretora.anos %></b><span>anos no alto padrão<br>residencial</span></div>
      <p class="lead">Cada imóvel tem uma página própria, enviada diretamente pela Daniela. Quer conhecer as oportunidades disponíveis?</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--wa" href="<%= waLink %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.5 14.4c-.3-.1-1.8-.9-2-1-.3-.1-.5-.1-.7.1-.2.3-.8 1-.9 1.2-.2.2-.3.2-.6.1-.3-.1-1.3-.5-2.4-1.5-.9-.8-1.5-1.8-1.7-2.1-.2-.3 0-.5.1-.6l.4-.5c.2-.2.2-.3.3-.5.1-.2 0-.4 0-.5-.1-.1-.7-1.6-.9-2.2-.2-.6-.5-.5-.7-.5h-.6c-.2 0-.5.1-.8.4-.3.3-1 1-1 2.5s1.1 2.9 1.2 3.1c.1.2 2.1 3.2 5.1 4.5.7.3 1.3.5 1.7.6.7.2 1.4.2 1.9.1.6-.1 1.8-.7 2-1.4.2-.7.2-1.3.2-1.4-.1-.2-.3-.3-.6-.4M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2m0 18.3c-1.5 0-3-.4-4.3-1.2l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.3 8.3 0 1 1 12 20.3"/></svg>
          Falar no WhatsApp
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--line" href="<%= imovel.corretora.site %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver o site</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer><%= imovel.corretora.nome %> · <%= imovel.corretora.creci %> · <%= imovel.corretora.telefone %></footer>
</body>
</html>
